WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.780
- I wanted to ask though about your kids.

00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:02.780
So is it true that your daughter

00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:04.160
is giving you music education?

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:05.030
