00:00:05.030 --> 00:00:06.090
- Yeah.

00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:06.923
- How so?

00:00:06.923 --> 00:00:08.310
- I'm weak. I'm so weak for her.

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:10.500
It's so bad. Ugh.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:13.550
Like, I taught her some old school music

00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:15.510
that I grew up on and
I hope that she would.

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:18.780
So I introduced her to like
"Candy Girl" by New Edition.

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:19.810
Right.

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:22.820
And you know, the highlight
of my year last year,

00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:24.040
is she got into the car

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:28.982
and she said, "Dad, can
you play Candy Girl?"

00:00:28.982 --> 00:00:31.018
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:31.018 --> 00:00:31.851
- [Kelly] Tear.

00:00:31.851 --> 00:00:34.561
- I was just like, "Yeah,
I got you. I got you."

00:00:34.561 --> 00:00:35.510
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:38.150
And then she asked for like Blank Space.

00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:39.460
and you know, other songs.

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:40.440
And so, yeah.

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:42.770
And so in my car, like, it'll play that

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:45.190
and then it'll play other
songs in that genre.

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:46.023
Right.

00:00:46.023 --> 00:00:47.009
And some of your music comes on.

00:00:47.009 --> 00:00:48.080
- Yeah. It's Pop, yeah.

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:52.690
- So it's amazing because
I'll drop her off at school

00:00:52.690 --> 00:00:55.090
and then I'll get back in the car

00:00:55.090 --> 00:00:58.160
and I am singing full throttle

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:00.987
to like Ariana Grande's "The Way".

00:01:01.960 --> 00:01:03.570
And I'll stop at a light

00:01:03.570 --> 00:01:05.190
and I'm jamming and I'll look over

00:01:05.190 --> 00:01:07.940
and the person is looking
at me and I'm like...

00:01:07.940 --> 00:01:08.982
- [Kelly] That's right.

00:01:08.982 --> 00:01:10.970
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:11.803
That's right.

00:01:11.803 --> 00:01:13.660
- I used, I used to, I
used to be a sex symbol.

00:01:13.660 --> 00:01:14.493
I'm sorry.

00:01:14.493 --> 00:01:15.326
- [Kelly] I used to be cool.

00:01:15.326 --> 00:01:16.777
I used to be so cool.

00:01:16.777 --> 00:01:18.250
- But I love this music.

00:01:18.250 --> 00:01:19.083
- Now I'm jamming.

00:01:19.083 --> 00:01:21.410
- I don't know what it is,
but it makes my daughter smile

00:01:21.410 --> 00:01:23.550
and happy, so it works for me.

00:01:23.550 --> 00:01:25.090
- And it reminds you of, so I-

00:01:25.090 --> 00:01:26.100
