00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:27.990
- I drop my kids off and they
like to listen to Encanto

00:01:27.990 --> 00:01:29.270
right now, the whole soundtrack.

00:01:29.270 --> 00:01:30.103
- Oh, that movie's incredible.

00:01:30.103 --> 00:01:30.936
- [Kelly] It's so incredible.

00:01:30.936 --> 00:01:33.753
So like, I drop them off
and I get back in the car.

00:01:33.753 --> 00:01:34.586
- [Michael] Bruno.

00:01:34.586 --> 00:01:35.419
